WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Tutorial 1: Quick Add. Start on Home. Quick Add is in the top card on Home.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.167
Select Quick Add. Select it. The camera opens.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:14.167
First time only: Allow the camera. Your browser asks to use the camera. Choose
Allow. On a phone it may say While using the app.

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:20.834
If you chose Block. Quick Add says so. Allow the camera in your browser's site
settings, then reopen it.

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:24.667
Quick Add is a camera. Set up first, then shoot.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:28.500
Universe. Choose the type of collectible.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.000
Pick one, such as Sports. This is optional. You can change it later.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.917
Category. Narrow it down if you want.

00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:40.917
Pick a category. Also optional. You can still shoot without one.

00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:45.417
Take the photo. Tap the round button to photograph your item.

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:50.250
Photo captured. The counter goes up. The photo appears bottom left.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:55.417
One photo per item. Repeat for each item. When you are done, select Finished.

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:59.917
Check your photos. Every photo is listed. Remove the accidental one.

00:00:59.917 --> 00:01:04.417
Three items remain. Undo is there if you change your mind.

00:01:04.417 --> 00:01:10.167
Fix a category. Item 3 is a toy. Change its Category to Toys and Figures.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:14.084
Name each item. Type a name for each item.

00:01:14.084 --> 00:01:19.251
Name each item. An item with no name is saved as Untitled Item.

00:01:19.251 --> 00:01:25.668
Add what you know. Cost is what you paid. Leave it empty if unknown. Empty is
not zero.

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:29.585
Save. Select Save 3 items to Vault.

00:01:29.585 --> 00:01:35.002
Saved. A message confirms the save, and you land in your Vault.

00:01:35.002 --> 00:01:40.169
Your new items. All three are in the Vault, each with its photo.

00:01:40.169 --> 00:01:45.002
Find an item later. Type part of its name in the search box.

00:01:45.002 --> 00:01:50.169
Open it to check. The photo and details are exactly as you saved them.

00:01:50.169 --> 00:01:54.169
On a phone: Same steps, new layout. Quick Add sits in a bar near the bottom of
Home.

00:01:54.169 --> 00:01:59.586
Quick Add on a phone. Find Quick Add in the bar at the bottom of Home.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:03.503
The camera fills the screen. Finished is at the top right.

00:02:03.503 --> 00:02:08.670
Review your photos. Tap Finished, or the small picture at the bottom left.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:13.503
Name, then save. Type a name for each item, then tap Save.

00:02:13.503 --> 00:02:17.670
Back in your Vault. Scroll down to see your new items.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:25.670
Recap: You used Quick Add. Open Quick Add from Home. One photo per item, then
Finished. Remove bad photos, fix categories, name your items. Save, then find
them in your Vault.
